//! Official http package: listen, dispatch, and `@Get` / `@Post` on controllers.
//! The language stores `@Name`. This package decides what Get/Post/Controller/Param/Query/Body/Valid do.
//! `http.app()` indexes loaded `@Controller` types and builds them via `of` / `empty`.
//! `@PathPrefix("/api")` prepends `/api` to `@Controller` under `src/modules/`.
//! `@Cors` reads associated `properties() -> CorsProperties` (`allowedOrigins` / `allowedOriginPatterns`).
//! `@Valid` on a method calls `classValidator.validate` on bound structs except `self`; every issue is `422` JSON `{"issues":[…]}`. The app must depend on `classValidator`.
//! Localhost is always allowed (host overlay). Not `@Inject`.
//! Not a macro. Not a `src/` walk.
//! Host overlay: `httpDispatch` / `httpListen` / `httpI32Param` / `httpRouterController` / `httpApp` / `httpFail`.
//! `@ErrorHandler` associated `handle(err, req)` maps `Error` to `Response`. `abort` / `fail` call it.
